  "description": "# Incheon\n\n**ICN · v0.4.0**\n\nCustom map of Incheon, Korea, built from official Korean government transport and demographic data.\n\n## Coverage\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><td><strong>Region</strong></td><td>경기도, 인천광역시, 서울특별시</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Playable Area</strong></td><td>1,610 km²</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<details>\n<summary>District list (30)</summary>\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><th align=\"left\">시군구</th><th align=\"left\">District</th><th align=\"right\">Population</th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>경기도 (Gyeonggi-do)</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>고양시 덕양구</td><td>Deogyang-gu Goyang-si</td><td align=\"right\">334,742</td></tr>\n<tr><td>광명시</td><td>Gwangmyeong-si</td><td align=\"right\">302,390</td></tr>\n<tr><td>군포시</td><td>Gunpo-si</td><td align=\"right\">158,123</td></tr>\n<tr><td>김포시</td><td>Gimpo-si</td><td align=\"right\">188,833</td></tr>\n<tr><td>부천시 소사구</td><td>Sosa-gu Bucheon-si</td><td align=\"right\">224,842</td></tr>\n<tr><td>부천시 오정구</td><td>Ojeong-gu Bucheon-si</td><td align=\"right\">203,515</td></tr>\n<tr><td>부천시 원미구</td><td>Wonmi-gu Bucheon-si</td><td align=\"right\">432,665</td></tr>\n<tr><td>성남시 중원구</td><td>Jungwon-gu Seongnam-si</td><td align=\"right\">361,984</td></tr>\n<tr><td>시흥시</td><td>Siheung-si</td><td align=\"right\">601,709</td></tr>\n<tr><td>안산시 단원구</td><td>Danwon-gu Ansan-si</td><td align=\"right\">256,514</td></tr>\n<tr><td>안산시 상록구</td><td>Sangnok-gu Ansan-si</td><td align=\"right\">400,060</td></tr>\n<tr><td>안양시 만안구</td><td>Manan-gu Anyang-si</td><td align=\"right\">198,789</td></tr>\n<tr><td>화성시</td><td>Hwaseong-si</td><td align=\"right\">27,015</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>인천광역시 (Incheon)</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>강화군</td><td>Ganghwa-gun</td><td align=\"right\">7,197</td></tr>\n<tr><td>계양구</td><td>Gyeyang-gu</td><td align=\"right\">277,157</td></tr>\n<tr><td>남동구</td><td>Namdong-gu</td><td align=\"right\">520,445</td></tr>\n<tr><td>동구</td><td>Dong-gu</td><td align=\"right\">114,131</td></tr>\n<tr><td>미추홀구</td><td>Michuhol-gu</td><td align=\"right\">502,869</td></tr>\n<tr><td>부평구</td><td>Bupyeong-gu</td><td align=\"right\">489,390</td></tr>\n<tr><td>서구</td><td>Seo-gu</td><td align=\"right\">660,540</td></tr>\n<tr><td>연수구</td><td>Yeonsu-gu</td><td align=\"right\">410,050</td></tr>\n<tr><td>중구</td><td>Jung-gu</td><td align=\"right\">209,592</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>서울특별시 (Seoul)</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>강서구</td><td>Gangseo-gu</td><td align=\"right\">119,850</td></tr>\n<tr><td>구로구</td><td>Guro-gu</td><td align=\"right\">150,607</td></tr>\n<tr><td>금천구</td><td>Geumcheon-gu</td><td align=\"right\">80,515</td></tr>\n<tr><td>동작구</td><td>Dongjak-gu</td><td align=\"right\">47,967</td></tr>\n<tr><td>마포구</td><td>Mapo-gu</td><td align=\"right\">36,512</td></tr>\n<tr><td>서대문구</td><td>Seodaemun-gu</td><td align=\"right\">0</td></tr>\n<tr><td>영등포구</td><td>Yeongdeungpo-gu</td><td align=\"right\">67,692</td></tr>\n<tr><td>은평구</td><td>Eunpyeong-gu</td><td align=\"right\">55,582</td></tr>\n</table>\n</details>\n\n## Population Summary\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><td><strong>Total Modeled Demand</strong></td><td align=\"right\">13,902,954</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Pops</strong></td><td align=\"right\">127,773</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n## Additional Features\n\n- **Neighborhood Labels** — The map includes municipal and neighborhood labels derived from administrative boundary data.\n\t- 시도 (Si, Do - Metropolitan / Provincial level)\n\t- 시군구 (Si, Gun, Gu - City / County / District level)\n\t- 읍면동 (Eup, Myeon, Dong - Neighborhood level)\n- **Special Demand POIs** — Airport, HSR station, Bus terminal, University, Hospital, School, Park, Shopping Center, Tourist Attraction, Ferry Terminal (where applicable); each modeled with real ridership, catchment gravity, or enrollment/visitor data.\n\n## Data Sources\n\n- Korean Transportation Database (Korea Transport Institute, KOTI) (ktdb.go.kr)\n- V-world (Ministry of Land, Infrastructure and Transport, MOLIT) (vworld.kr)\n- Statistical Geographic Information System (SGIS) plus (Ministry of Data and Statistics, MODS) (sgis.mods.go.kr)\n- Address-based Industry Support Service (Ministry of the Interior and Safety, MOIS) (business.juso.go.kr)\n- Aviation statistics 2025 (Korea Civil Aviation Association, KCAA) (airportal.go.kr)\n- Korean railroad statistics 2024 (Korea Railroad, KORAIL) (railstat.korail.com)\n- Korean Public Transportation Database (Korea Transportation Safety Authority, KTSA) (kotsa.or.kr)\n- Korean Hospital and Pharmacy Status (Health Insurance Review and Assessment Service, HIRA) (data.go.kr)\n- Health Insurance Medical Statistics (HIRA) (opendata.hira.or.kr)\n- Academy Information System (Ministry of Education, MOE) (academyinfo.go.kr)\n- School Info Disclosure (schoolinfo.go.kr) and Korea National Standard Data (data.go.kr) — schools, parks, shopping centers, tourist attractions\n- Korea Transport Safety Authority (KOMSA) coastal ferry statistics (komsa.or.kr)\n\n## Credits\n\nMap authored by budhakr",
